// IntroString :
"P1367064739" "I've got a tip on one of those Carnival of Shadows parties. It's a very exclusive shindig, going on in some warehouse in Brickstown. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to check it out, {HeroName}.</A> The Carnival likes to have a good time, but sometimes that means that their guests wind up hurt."
// AcceptString :
"P2587639996" "Check out the Carnival of Shadows party"
// SendOffString :
"P2521571177" "Why do you always get to have all the fun, {HeroName}? If I had my way, I'd get in on the action one of these days."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P143689104" "Investigate Carnival's wild party"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1376343633" "I need you to get over to that Carnival soiree and see what's happening."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2745904251" "Like most exclusive parties, there's no sign that tells you this is the place. If you weren't in the know, you'd be out of luck."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1086500411" "Woo-hoo! What a party!"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
