// Dialog :
"P2121920012" "You rescued the last party-goer from the Carnival of Shadows."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3816365988" "Almost everybody at that party died? {HeroName}, how awful! That woman you rescued sounded so apathetic afterward. It's not natural. The Carnival did something to her, I know it! You know, I think I have an idea about how to investigate. But I'd rather not tell you just yet."
// RandomFameString :
"P2162530201" "My wife was at some strange party the other night. Now all she does is sleep!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2037632472" "You're going to be mad at me, {HeroName}, but I decided to take matters into my own hands. I went to one of the Carnival of Shadows parties last night! I wanted to help you investigate those mysterious deaths that occurred at their last party. Anyway, I'm sorry, but I actually don't remember much about it. I could learn to live with my lost memories, but when I came home, I was also missing my grandmother's ruby pendant. The Carnival must have taken it! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Please get my pendant back for me, {HeroName}.</A> It's all I have to remember Grams."
// AcceptString :
"P485049185" "Get the pendant back from the Carnival"
// SendOffString :
"P3310137066" "Thanks, {HeroName}. I'll never forget this."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3960396699" "Find {ContactName}'s pendant"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4260640675" "Have you got my pendant?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3705424863" "There's an aura of tension in this room, as though a great plan was nearing fruition."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4320995" "What is that thing anyway?"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1839726880" "Don't know. But the Mistress wants it."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3463263655" "You won't recover the gem!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2804358442" "The Soothsayer"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2270827685" "The transfer will be irrevocable."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3916695864" "Truss up {HeroName}!"

