"P1043947038" "You found the pendant!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - NotPendantCase 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P209516983" "You found some stolen silver cutlery, but no pendant."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - NotPendantCase 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P803326617" "You found some stolen gold watches, but no pendant."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3234576105" "You defeated the Carnival's minions and recovered {ContactName}'s pendant."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P344573367" "Oh, my pendant! Thank you, {HeroName}! Let me just slip it on; I promise it'll never leave my neck again. <br><br>Forever and ever, you will serve my indomitable will. <br><br>Oh. Oh, my! {HeroName}, when I put that pendant on, I was overcome. Memories, emotions. Some of them were mine, but most weren't. I could almost glimpse the Carnival's plan! They must have infused my pendant with some of their power!"
// RandomFameString :
"P3770564345" "Have you seen {ContactName} lately? She looks pretty shaken up."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3208503899" "The Carnival of Shadows definitely did something to my pendant while it was in their possession. Ever since you returned it to me, I've been recovering more and more of my memories about that party. {HeroName}, this is awful, but I think some people died! One of them, I think his name was Nathan Crane. Yes! Yes, I'm sure that's right. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd really like you to go over to his office and see if you can find out why the Carnival would want him dead.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1707983471" "Go to Nathan Crane's office and find out why the Carnival would want him dead"
// SendOffString :
"P1177760758" "I'm feeling pretty shaken, {HeroName}. I was there, while the Carnival was killing people! And I couldn't do anything about it."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2807627967" "Defeat all carnies in office"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1450902537" "I need to know why the Carnival killed Nathan Crane. {HeroName}, I need to!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3474968380" "The abrupt bleat of a horn makes you jump."
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P4109176802" "We're supposed to get every scrap of paper in this place."
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P1216713714" "Work, work, work. When do we play?"
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 :
"P3510547691" "Play time!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 :
"P1257436997" "Care to tango?"
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P102241051" "It looks like Crane was getting close to learning the truth."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1543388961" "Well, he won't be getting any closer."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2167349649" "Wanna arm wrestle?"

