"P1469950025" "Searching..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1446961996" "You found some files on the Carnival!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4288304622" "You defeated the Carnival and found an interesting file."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P610920804" "So, Nathan Crane was investigating the Carnival, huh? I guess that's why they murdered him. Maybe he was getting close to something. We'll have to keep digging, {HeroName}. I've got to find out why he died!"
// RandomFameString :
"P3674893700" "{ContactName} doesn't seem herself lately."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Errand4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1967914224" "If we can find Nathan Crane's stolen files, maybe we can find out why the Carnival murdered him. I'm sure he must have been on the trail of some big secret. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>{HeroName}, take to the streets at once.</A> One of those Carnival minions knows where those files are. And I aim to find out which one!"
// AcceptString :
"P2703013301" "Take to the streets"
// SendOffString :
"P1037849211" "I guess I've been a little curt lately. Sorry about that. I really don't know what's gotten into me."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2715214292" "Interrogate carnies about files"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1995387237" "I don't see any files around here, do you?"
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1486573911" "Let's play pinball!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1453187504" "On one of the Carnival minions, you found a note."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3030200443" "Do you need me to hold your hand through everything? You know where the files are! Get moving!"
// RandomFameString :
"P369121135" "Did you see {ContactName} bawl out {HeroName} earlier? Sheesh, how embarrassing!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2400073702" "{HeroName}, I really must apologize. I don't know what's gotten into me lately. I guess it's the thought that I was actually at a party while the Carnival was killing people. It's messing with my head. Anyway, I appreciate your work on this Carnival of Shadows problem. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Now that you know where they're keeping Nathan Crane's files, we can go in and get them.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P860161814" "Get Nathan Crane's files from the Carnival of Shadows"
// SendOffString :
"P2895621537" "Thanks, {HeroName}. You've been great through all of this. Just get in, find those files, and get out. They're probably being stored in a desk of file cabinet somewhere."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2431013366" "Find Nathan Crane's files"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1814806189" "we need those files, {HeroName}. We need to know what the Carnival of Shadows is plotting!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2083023152" "Ever since you recovered {ContactName}'s pendant from the Carnival of Shadows, she's been acting more than a little odd. You can only hope it isn't permanent."
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P4083242760" "What am I, a bookkeeper? Look at this bod!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P957599900" "Let's just find the files and get out of here."
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 :
"P3012552542" "Hey! A playmate!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 :
"P436570355" "You look like you could use a good battle!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - StolenFiles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3867581679" "You found Nathan Crane's stolen files."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3726371953" "Excellent. Nathan Crane's files on the Carnival are certainly comprehensive. I thought we had managed to keep most of this stuff a secret. Ah well, he won't be talking now. What's the matter, {HeroName}? Why are you looking at me like that?"
// RandomFameString :
"P559672547" "I hear {HeroName}'s onto something big about the Carnival of Shadows."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2641138814" "Based on the notes of Nathan Crane, it looks like the Carnival's masks may hide more than just their faces. If they really are linked to the Carnival's powers, we have a unique opportunity to learn more about our foes. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to go to one of the Carnival's bases and recover one of their masks.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3493114258" "Go to one of the Carnival's bases and recover one of their masks"
// SendOffString :
"P1089966014" "You see, I'm much more myself now. I tell you, my bad mood was just stress. There's no need to be so concerned."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4199190307" "Stop Ring Mistress & her minions"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P939501843" "We need to get our hands on one of the Carnival's masks!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P276145398" "The door was open, the party music audible from the street. You can't shake the feeling that you were expected."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P104729370" "This new boon is most unexpected."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P167217098" "We'll have to see what comes of it."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2823113850" "Are you in for a treat!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3030015770" "Madame of Mystery"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3601510955" "{HeroName} has no idea what's in store."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3726849786" "Ah, my dear. So nice of you to join us."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3540377907" "You took a mask from one of the Carnival minions you defeated."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P414167129" "Ah, the mask. Isn't it lovely? Can you imagine looking upon this visage while your psyche was torn to shreds?"
// RandomFameString :
"P580064487" "I used to like watching the Super Days, but lately Live Wire gives me the creeps."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3629532639" "I've contacted Cadao Kestrel, the voodoo master. I think he may be able to help us unravel the mysteries of that mask you recovered from the Carnival. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Would you care to pay him a visit?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1080290645" "Take the mask to Cadao Kestrel"
// SendOffString :
"P2630500933" "I have to admit, I'm reluctant to part with this lovely mask. Ah, well. All in the name of heroism, I suppose."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound7_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1968487561" "Take mask to Cadao Kestrel"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3381176073" "I really think Cadao Kestrel can tell us about that mask."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P693204657" "That mask isn't for the likes of you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2260046137" "So, this is the mask {ContactName} spoke of. Yes. There definitely is some sort of strange energy within. I will require some time to plumb its depths. While you are waiting, would you please go to Peregrine Island and deal with a problem that has been troubling me? As usual, the Carnival is fighting the Rikti tooth and nail, and their battle in Peregrine Island has become far too dangerous. I need you to put some space between them, so we can all breathe more easily."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound7_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P476111193" "End war between groups"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3962484019" "Cadao asked you for a personal favor. If I were you, I'd be flattered that he wanted my assistance."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1485401236" "It's {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2350946461" "You have created a buffer zone between the Carnival and the Rikti."
// RandomFameString :
"P209212558" "Did you see {HeroName} cracking heads?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound7_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P20599384" "Return to Cadao Kestrel"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4025049342" "Cadao ought to have some results for you by now. You should go see what he's learned."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P706695644" "That's the one!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2682455385" "{HeroName}, I must admit that I am deeply shaken. This mask you found contains fragments of human souls! I believe that is the key to the Carnival's strange power. They have mastered the ability to transfer souls, in whole or in part, to physical objects. I believe this mask contains a fragment of the soul of the Carnival's leader. By transferring portions of her soul to the mask, she is able to share her powers with all of her followers. <br><br>I would tell you more if I could, but it is beyond my power to communicate with the scraps of soul trapped within the mask. For that, you must see someone wiser than I."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1767660966" "So, the Carnival mistress grants her minions a portion of her power by putting a fragment of her soul into each mask. Interesting, {HeroName}, very interesting. I'd like to know more."
// RandomFameString :
"P1775764684" "I think {HeroName}'s worried about something."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Errand8.1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2313401431" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>Cadao Kestrel recommended that you take that Carnival mask over to Penelope Yin.</A> Perhaps she can communicate with the souls Cadao sensed trapped inside it."
// AcceptString :
"P135642749" "Take the mask to Penelope Yin."
// SendOffString :
"P2154480931" "Penelope Yin's one of the smartest women I know. Even if she is a little prissy."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4238756426" "Take mask to Penelope Yin"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1395292174" "Penelope Yin may be able to communicate with the scraps of soul inside that mask. At least, that's what Cadao thinks."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2266764859" "Give it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2997589926" "There are fragments of a dozen souls imprisoned within this mask! Most are mere shadows of souls, too small to have much substance. Come closer, and I'll let you speak to those souls that are more assertive. There is one in particular who wants to help you with your quest."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1962313622" "So, the Carnival is supping on souls, eh? Sweet, delicious souls. <br><br>You know, {HeroName}, I really wish you'd quit giving me that look."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission9 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4135338680" "So, the soul of Nathan Crane believes it can lead you to a secret Midnight Squad library? I guess it's worth a shot. After all, if the Carnival really is interested in this Sicilian Stone, it can't hurt for us to learn more about it. All right, {HeroName}, you've got my blessing. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go get your hands on those tomes.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2010255082" "Get the tomes from the secret library"
// SendOffString :
"P3844623967" "The mask should lead you right to the spot."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2825478206" "Defeat all Carnival minions"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P94493693" "I thought you had some books to find."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1291738911" "Imprisoned within the porcelain mask, the soul of Nathan Crane reaches out to you. You feel a sudden warm wash of nostalgia for this secret library, where Nathan spent many happy hours."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3956091812" "We've got to find those tomes before {HeroName} does."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2573484042" "We can't have him learning the truth."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1368583090" "All we have to do is keep you busy!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3267098594" "Find the files, Sally. Find the tomes, Sally. Geez, what a drag."
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P259033067" "Just shut your yap and keep searching."
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 :
"P2219598502" "I found something! Something big!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 :
"P3035701701" "Gotcha!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2972322274" "{HeroName} must not read those tomes!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2525713890" "It will soon be too late for you to stop us!"

