"P96049305" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to take those tomes you recovered to Cadao Kestrel for study.</A> It seems that he may be able to help us figure out why the Carnival is after this strange Sicilian Stone."
// AcceptString :
"P3961086994" "Take tomes to Cadao Kestrel"
// SendOffString :
"P3531153529" "You know, {HeroName}, I've been thinking the Carnival isn't so bad after all. After we wrap this one up, what do you say we turn our attention to other matters?"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3144217327" "Cadao needs to see those tomes."
