"P2801988030" "Get the tomes!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2920805297" "Thank you, my friend. You know, the Sicilian Stone was once used to imprison the soul of a duke who wore the stone upon his breast. The stone gradually sucked in the man's soul, until there was nothing left of him. It's been lost for years, of course, but perhaps the Carnival knows where to find it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P139152060" "Job well done, {HeroName}. I'm sure Cadao will be able to tell us more about the Carnival's motives in short order. You might as well go save some of those pesky citizens you love so much. I'll be here waiting when you get back."
// RandomFameString :
"P2485588338" "{HeroName} looks blue."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound11 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3776524577" "Cadao Kestrel just called. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>He's finished studying those books you found on the Sicilian Stone, and he wants to talk to you about his findings.</A> I think he may have learned why the Carnival of Shadows is after the Stone."
// AcceptString :
"P3575137635" "Talk to Cadao Kestrel about his findings"
// SendOffString :
"P2783997386" "Cadao wouldn't say much to me on the phone. When you see him, tell him I thought he was mighty rude."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound11_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1607741799" "Talk to Cadao Kestrel"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2999830527" "Cadao's waiting on you."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2119882918" "{HeroName} mustn't learn the truth!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P471924117" "I have grave news for you, my friend. When you battled the Carnival at that library, they weren't researching the Sicilian Stone. They were simply trying to keep you from learning about it. You see, they already knew where the Stone was! <br><br>Do you remember that pendant the Carnival stole from {ContactName}? It was the Sicilian Stone! By the time you recovered it, the Carnival had already empowered the stone. When {ContactName} put it on, she began to gain access to the Carnival's memories. But none of us realized that the exchange was not one-way. Every time {ContactName} remembers something else, a portion of her soul is sucked into the stone. Then it is the Carnival's to command. <br><br>If we don't restore her soul quickly, it will forever belong to the Carnival. I know a ritual that may help, but I'll need some rare herbs."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound11_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1321090172" "Find the herbs"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3079843467" "If Cadao sent you on an errand, I should know about it. What do you mean, you can't say?"
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1542474195" "{HeroName} mustn't get the herb!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3481934247" "According to Cadao, the herbs he needs only grow on the bones of the unburied dead. A chilling thought."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Bones 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2014914614" "Bones of the unburied dead"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2984616034" "You begin to examine the bones."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1592935296" "You have finished examining the bones."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P247459945" "There bones were covered with Cadao's rare herb!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3004398861" "You got the herb."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound11_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2533419369" "Take herb to Cadao Kestrel"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3747238444" "Are you and Cadao plotting something, {HeroName}? Answer me!"
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1525454955" "Stop {HeroName} at all costs!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1901569115" "Thank you, {HeroName}. As {ContactName}'s soul is drawn into the Sicilian Stone, it comes more and more under the Carnival's command. The Madame of Mystery you have faced three times? She is none other than the psychic projection of {ContactName}'s soul. In order to restore the soul to its proper owner, you must rip apart the psychic projection. No, not just physically. You must rip it apart on a psychic level. With this herb you have brought me, I will mix a draught that will give you the power to do so. Come back and see me shortly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3952370790" "You and Cadao can have your little joke, but it's not very nice to leave your own contact out of the loop. I'm your best chance of dealing with the Carnival of Shadows. Why won't you talk to me?"
// RandomFameString :
"P3803076126" "Every time I see {ContactName}, she seems a little stranger."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound12 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2841211861" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>Cadao Kestrel wants to see you again, and, as usual, he won't tell me what it's about.</A> I don't appreciate all this secrecy, {HeroName}."
// SendOffString :
"P1633850152" "I don't understand why you and Cadao feel you have to keep me in the dark."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound12_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P270382417" "I need you to get those tomes over to Cadao."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P35648083" "{ContactName} is ours!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1805909277" "Drink this draught, {HeroName}. It will grant you the power you need to defeat the Madame of Mystery, {ContactName}'s psychic self, once and for all. When you have done so, the Carnival's hold on her soul will be broken. I must warn you, by now Madeleine's soul is nearly consumed. That means the Madame will be far, far stronger than during your earlier encounters."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound12_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3293369396" "Defeat Madame of Mystery & crew"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P108793660" "I'm not talking to you. Whatever mission Cadao sent you on, you can carry out without my help."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P57705805" "Somewhere in this warehouse, {ContactName}'s psychically projected self awaits you. You square your shoulders. You're going to have to kick her butt."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3363473565" "Another minute, and it will be too late for {HeroName} to stop my transformation."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2338955509" "<em fancybow f=a>So, you have learned the truth! <em point f=a>Fool! You will never recover your precious friend Madeleine! <em laugh f=a>I am part of the Carnival now!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P764638332" "I will offer your soul to the Carnival Mistress!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P4000838293" "Free. Yes. You have freed me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Madame 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4204917606" "You defeated the Madame of Mystery, freeing {ContactName}'s soul from the Carnival's control."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P615605200" "You're saying all this time, my soul was being sucked into the pendant? Oh, {HeroName}, I don't know what to say! You saved me! You saved my soul from being bound to the Carnival forever! Words can't describe my gratitude; somehow, I've got to make this up to you."
// RandomFameString :
"P3976013256" "I hear {HeroName} saved {ContactName}'s soul!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// RandomFameString :
"P3699403604" "I hear {HeroName} saved Madeleine Casey!"
